Name: IndicTransToolkit
Short Name: indictranstoolkit
URL: https://github.com/VarunGumma/IndicTransToolkit
Version: 1.1.1
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
Varun Gumma's IndicTransToolkit: IndicTrans2's input and output processing
(IndicProcessor).

Local Modifications:
The processing caption text reaches (normalise, tokenise, write in
Devanagari, and back) ported to C++ in components/tark_captions/indic_text.cc
and translation_engine.cc. No Python is shipped.
